.TH LSUSERS 1 "July 2026" "lsusers 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
lsusers \- list Linux user accounts simply
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B lsusers
.RI [ command ]
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
lsusers lists Linux user accounts using the system account database.
By default it lists human users.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B all
List all users.
.TP
.B human
List human users.
.TP
.B system
List system users.
.TP
.B count
Show user counts.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --json
Output JSON.
.TP
.B --csv
Output CSV.
.TP
.B --names
Output usernames only.
.TP
.B --version
Show version.
.TP
.B --help
Show help.
